  m_Name: help_waterworks
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Antarium.Content::Antarium.Content.HelpTopicDef
  id: help_waterworks
  displayName: Pumps, wheels and farms
  order: 440
  category: World
  icon: building_water_wheel
  body: 'Water never rises by itself: a Pump moves water or gas from behind it out of its spout. Chain pumps to lift water higher, drain a flooded shaft or blow gas out.


    A Water Wheel turns while water pours through it and speeds up the machines around it. Put it under a waterfall or a pump''s outlet.


    Fungus Gardens and Aphid Ranches with water next to them make more. A Smelter touching lava, magma rock or fire works faster and needs no coal.'
  reveal: 2
  revealBiome: {fileID: 0}
  revealResearch: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b210b69a701da4947851cbcad9f670cf, type: 2}
